   {
    "id": "a-quieter-side-of-amalfi",
    "slug": "a-quieter-side-of-amalfi",
    "status": "published",
    "taxonomies": {
     "category": [
      "europe"
     ],
     "tag": [
      "slow-travel",
      "small-towns"
     ]
    },
    "data": {
     "title": "A Quieter Side of Amalfi",
     "deck": "Beyond the busy piazzas, a slower rhythm reveals itself.",
     "excerpt": "Beyond the busy piazzas, a slower rhythm reveals a more soulful Amalfi Coast — with hilltop villages, lemon groves and endless views.",
     "content": [
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k1",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Leave the main square",
         "_key": "k2",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k3",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Most visitors arrive by ferry and stay near the harbour. Walk ten minutes uphill and the noise thins out: laundry lines, cats on warm steps and the smell of lemon peel from open kitchen doors.",
         "_key": "k4",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k5",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Hilltop villages",
         "_key": "k6",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k7",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "The villages above the coast keep a different clock. Bars open early, close for lunch and fill again at dusk, when everyone seems to know everyone else.",
         "_key": "k8",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k9",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Lemon groves and long views",
         "_key": "k10",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k11",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "A terraced path between groves is the best way to understand the landscape. Go early, carry water and stop wherever the sea comes into view.",
         "_key": "k12",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "photo": "/images/amalfi-cove.webp",
     "photo_alt": "Hillside houses above a blue bay on the Amalfi Coast",
     "region": "europe",
     "topic": "Europe",
     "minutes": 6,
     "updated_on": "2024-03-22T09:00:00.000Z",
     "position": 10,
     "featured": true,
     "home_position": 0
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "by-train-through-the-highlands",
    "slug": "by-train-through-the-highlands",
    "status": "published",
    "taxonomies": {
     "category": [
      "europe"
     ],
     "tag": [
      "slow-travel",
      "trains"
     ]
    },
    "data": {
     "title": "By Train Through the Highlands",
     "deck": "Dramatic landscapes, quiet stations and a kinder way to see Scotland.",
     "excerpt": "Dramatic landscapes, quiet stations and a kinder way to see Scotland.",
     "content": [
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k13",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Choosing the line",
         "_key": "k14",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k15",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "The best Highland journeys are the ones that refuse to hurry: a single carriage, a timetable you can memorise and windows that open onto lochs and moorland.",
         "_key": "k16",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k17",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "What to pack",
         "_key": "k18",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k19",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "A flask, a paper map and a book you will not finish. The scenery does most of the work.",
         "_key": "k20",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k21",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Getting off early",
         "_key": "k22",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k23",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Pick a station with one café and one path. An unplanned afternoon is the point of travelling this way.",
         "_key": "k24",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "photo": "/images/highlands-train.webp",
     "photo_alt": "A steam train crossing a stone viaduct above green hills",
     "region": "europe",
     "topic": "Europe",
     "minutes": 5,
     "updated_on": "2024-02-14T09:00:00.000Z",
     "position": 20,
     "home_position": 1
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "small-towns-big-stories",
    "slug": "small-towns-big-stories",
    "status": "published",
    "taxonomies": {
     "category": [
      "europe"
     ],
     "tag": [
      "small-towns",
      "slow-travel"
     ]
    },
    "data": {
     "title": "Small Towns, Big Stories",
     "deck": "Why the smallest places often leave the biggest impression.",
     "excerpt": "Why the smallest places often leave the biggest impression.",
     "content": [
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k25",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Start with the lane",
         "_key": "k26",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k27",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Small towns reward attention. A shuttered door, a hand-painted sign or a neighbour's greeting tells you more than any landmark.",
         "_key": "k28",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k29",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Eat where the menu is short",
         "_key": "k30",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k31",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Three dishes, written that morning, usually means someone cares about all three.",
         "_key": "k32",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k33",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Stay one night more",
         "_key": "k34",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k35",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "The second morning is when a place stops being a stop and starts feeling like somewhere you know.",
         "_key": "k36",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "photo": "/images/small-town-alley.webp",
     "photo_alt": "A whitewashed lane with flowering bougainvillea and a wall lantern",
     "region": "europe",
     "topic": "Culture",
     "minutes": 4,
     "updated_on": "2024-02-02T09:00:00.000Z",
     "position": 30,
     "home_position": 2
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "the-art-of-slower-travel",
    "slug": "the-art-of-slower-travel",
    "status": "published",
    "taxonomies": {
     "category": [
      "europe"
     ],
     "tag": [
      "slow-travel",
      "wellbeing"
     ]
    },
    "data": {
     "title": "The Art of Slower Travel",
     "deck": "How to linger longer, travel lighter and find more along the way.",
     "excerpt": "How to linger longer, travel lighter and find more along the way.",
     "content": [
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k37",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Fewer places, more days",
         "_key": "k38",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k39",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Choose one region and stay put. Every extra night spent in the same place buys you time to notice things.",
         "_key": "k40",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k41",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Travel lighter",
         "_key": "k42",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k43",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "A small bag keeps you walking, taking buses and saying yes to detours.",
         "_key": "k44",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k45",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Leave room for nothing",
         "_key": "k46",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k47",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Block out an afternoon with no plan. Most of the memories you keep will come from it.",
         "_key": "k48",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "photo": "/images/turquoise-cove.webp",
     "photo_alt": "A small boat on turquoise water beside rocky cliffs",
     "region": "europe",
     "topic": "Wellbeing",
     "minutes": 5,
     "updated_on": "2024-01-19T09:00:00.000Z",
     "position": 40,
     "home_position": 3
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "lakes-villages-and-long-afternoons",
    "slug": "lakes-villages-and-long-afternoons",
    "status": "published",
    "taxonomies": {
     "category": [
      "europe"
     ],
     "tag": [
      "small-towns",
      "slow-travel"
     ]
    },
    "data": {
     "title": "Lakes, Villages and Long Afternoons",
     "deck": "Sunset on the water and a church bell that keeps its own time.",
     "excerpt": "A lake shore, a village campanile and an afternoon that refuses to end.",
     "content": [
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k49",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "The lake road",
         "_key": "k50",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k51",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Skip the express boats and take the shore road. Every bend has a bench, and every bench has a view.",
         "_key": "k52",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k53",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Long lunches",
         "_key": "k54",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k55",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Lunch here is not a pit stop. Order slowly, and expect to still be at the table when the shadows reach the water.",
         "_key": "k56",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k57",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Evening on the quay",
         "_key": "k58",
         "marks": []
        }
