   {
    "id": "a-slow-weekend-by-the-sea",
    "slug": "a-slow-weekend-by-the-sea",
    "status": "published",
    "taxonomies": {
     "category": [
      "coastal"
     ],
     "tag": [
      "coastal-walks",
      "slow-travel",
      "small-towns"
     ]
    },
    "data": {
     "title": "A slow weekend by the sea",
     "deck": "Cobblestone lanes, morning markets and long lunches on the Amalfi Coast.",
     "excerpt": "Cobblestone lanes, morning markets and long lunches on the Amalfi Coast.",
     "content": [
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k97",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Arriving in Amalfi",
         "_key": "k98",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k99",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "The road to Amalfi winds between cliffs and lemon groves, each turn revealing another impossible view. As the sea comes into sight, the pace shifts — conversations soften, time stretches, and the weekend begins to feel like a different kind of escape.",
         "_key": "k100",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k101",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Amalfi isn't just a place to visit, but a feeling. A mix of sun-warmed stone, the scent of citrus, and the gentle rhythm of life by the water. It's the kind of destination that rewards a slower itinerary, where the best moments come unplanned.",
         "_key": "k102",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k103",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "A Quieter Pace",
         "_key": "k104",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k105",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Mornings start late and on purpose. A coffee at the counter, a walk to the harbour and a seat in the shade while the ferries come and go.",
         "_key": "k106",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k107",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "By midday the lanes empty out and the town exhales. This is the hour to do very little, and to do it well.",
         "_key": "k108",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k109",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Food, Markets and Local Flavours",
         "_key": "k110",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k111",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "The morning market is small and honest: lemons the size of fists, anchovies from the night boats, bread still warm from the oven. Buy a little of everything and eat it on the steps.",
         "_key": "k112",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k113",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Lunch is the main event. Order what the table beside you is eating, and ask for the local white.",
         "_key": "k114",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k115",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Coastal Walks",
         "_key": "k116",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k117",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "The Path of the Gods is famous, but the lower terraces are just as rewarding. Start early, follow the stone steps between lemon groves and stop whenever the sea appears.",
         "_key": "k118",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k119",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Carry water, wear shoes with grip and give yourself twice as long as you think you need.",
         "_key": "k120",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k121",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Where to Stay",
         "_key": "k122",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k123",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Choose a small guesthouse above the harbour rather than a hotel on the main road. You will trade a lobby for a terrace and a front-desk clerk for someone who knows which bakery opens first.",
         "_key": "k124",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k125",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Book for three nights if you can. The second morning is when the town starts to feel familiar.",
         "_key": "k126",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k127",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Final Thoughts",
         "_key": "k128",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k129",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "A weekend is not much time, but it is enough to change the speed at which you travel. Leave a little unplanned, walk where the paths are narrow and let the coast set the pace.",
         "_key": "k130",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "photo": "/images/village-flowers.webp",
     "photo_alt": "Pastel houses and bougainvillea above the sea on the Amalfi Coast",
     "region": "coastal",
     "topic": "Italy / Coastal towns",
     "minutes": 8,
     "updated_on": "2024-04-18T09:00:00.000Z",
     "position": 85,
     "inline_photo": "/images/lantern-stair.webp",
     "inline_alt": "A stone stair beneath a lantern, lemon branches and a view over the sea"
    }
   },
