     "title": "Hills, Markets and Morning Light",
     "deck": "From hillside towns in Umbria to the simple pleasures of local markets.",
     "excerpt": "A month of slow days in Umbria: hillside towns, local markets and the beauty in between.",
     "content": [
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k131",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Hillside towns",
         "_key": "k132",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k133",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Umbria's towns sit on their hills like crowns. Park outside the walls and walk up; the climb is part of the arrival.",
         "_key": "k134",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k135",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Market days",
         "_key": "k136",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k137",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Every town has its own market morning. Go for the produce, stay for the conversations.",
         "_key": "k138",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "h2",
       "_key": "k139",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "Morning light",
         "_key": "k140",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "block",
       "style": "normal",
       "_key": "k141",
       "markDefs": [],
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "The valley fills with gold before breakfast. Get up for it at least once.",
         "_key": "k142",
         "marks": []
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "photo": "/images/umbria-alley.webp",
